000800C6                            
000800C6 =0007DFAE                  MegaPCM_LoadDriver:	equ	MegaPCMLibraryBlob+$0
000800C6 =0007E018                  MegaPCM_LoadSampleTable:	equ	MegaPCMLibraryBlob+$6A
